      "case_id": "V2-011",
      "question": "什么情况下一个助手已经足够，什么情况下值得拆成多个角色？",
      "category": "paraphrase",
      "split": "dev",
      "group": "A011",
      "variant": "expanded",
      "expected_sources": [
